=====================================
            TLDR GUIDE
=====================================


::KEY FEATURES::
-------------------------------------
Map Creation: Grid editor with symbols.
Symbol Placement: Select + left-click.
Properties: Color/texture/name/value/etc.
Arc Builder: Story/events linked to maps.
Multi-Select: Drag for copy/cut/paste.
Undo/Redo: Grid + arc edits.
Preview: Map/dictionary views.
Import/Export: .tmap/.mapd/.arcs.


::SHORTCUTS::
-------------------------------------
Tab: Cycle sections (symbols/arcs/etc.).
Shift-Tab: Next listbox item.
Ctrl+Return: Right-click at mouse.
W/A/S/D/Arrows: Scroll canvas.
Wheel: Vertical scroll.
Shift+Wheel: Horizontal scroll.
Page Up/Down: Page vertical.
Left Click: Place/start select.
Right Click: Remove/select cell.
Lock Apply: Batch on symbols.
Esc: Deselect/cancel.


::TIPS::
-------------------------------------
Lock for batch props.
Attach arcs for stories.
Script Gen: Inject enemy/NPC data.
Phrases: Common arc terms.
Door Guide: Connection rules.
Arc Guide: Advanced scripting.
Mini-Map: Connect maps visually.
Waypoints: 'Q' home (many instances), 'I' instance (1 connection).
Check files for lists/guides.

=====================================
  See map.help, arc.help, door.guide.
=====================================
